{
  "name": "dsh-ip-studio",
  "description": "认知差内容工作室：把论文/素材/资讯整理成可发布成稿的个人 IP 引擎，含确定性红线终检与多平台排版，并可作为通用 Agent Skill 装进 Claude Code / Cursor / Copilot。Perceptive-gap content studio for DeepSeek Harness: material → publish-ready drafts, with deterministic red-line review, multi-platform formatting, and a portable Agent Skill.",
